<title>USA: AMEX to delist Kenwin Shops shares.</title>
<headline>AMEX to delist Kenwin Shops shares.</headline>
<dateline>STONE MOUNTAIN, Ga. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenwin Shops Inc said on Wednesday the American Stock Exchange is delisting the company for not satisfying the exchange's financial guidelines.</p>
<p>Kenwin Shops is currently appealing the decision, but there is no assurance that the company's listing on the exchange will continue, it said.</p>
